            "repere": "Paragraphe · Countdown to Christmas with 24 unique …",
            "text": "Countdown to Christmas with 24 unique limited edition jams & spreads. Discover delicious flavors such as Caramel with Salted Butter, Strawberry with Madagascar Vanilla or Raspberry with Dark Chocolate that can only be found during the holiday season. Perfect for gifting or treating yourself!",
