            "slot": "s849",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Made Simply, With Love! The NEW 2026 L…",
            "text": "<span style=\"font-weight:700\">Made Simply, With Love!</span> The NEW 2026 Limited Edition Bonne Maman Advent Calendar is here. Inside each of its 24 adorable mini boxes, is a unique flavor of Bonne Maman made with simple ingredients — for a homemade taste that everyone is sure to love.",
