        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s850",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · This year's Limited Edition Bonne Mama…",
            "text": "This year's Limited Edition Bonne Maman Advent Calendar unwraps a brand-new design: a beautifully illustrated gift box overflowing with festive ornaments, ribbon, and holiday surprises. It's joyful, and makes a delightful centerpiece for your countdown to Christmas.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s851",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · And once the countdown is over, repurp…",
            "text": "And once the countdown is over, repurpose each charming mini box for stocking stuffers, place settings, or tiny treasures, a delightful way to extend the magic!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s852",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Perfect for gifting or treating yourse…",
            "text": "Perfect for gifting or treating yourself, the Bonne Maman Advent Calendar spreads joy and celebrates the holidays in a deliciously unforgettable way. Whether near or far, you can even create a new tradition by (virtually) opening each advent day together with a loved one.",
