            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s853",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Available in limited quantities each h…",
            "text": "Available in limited quantities each holiday season, once it's gone, it's gone until next year. Although you'll most likely finish these 24 delicious flavors quickly, make sure to enjoy them before June 2027 for the optimal flavor experience.",
